### Unit Arithmetic

#### allows same-family addition

- Verify: allows same-family addition


<details>
<summary>Executable SSpec</summary>

Runnable source: 8 lines folded for reproduction.
Reproduction: this block contains the complete executable scenario source.

```simple
step("Verify: allows same-family addition")
# @req: REQ-FEATURE-UnitType-001
unit length(base: f64): m = 1.0, km = 1000.0:
    allow add(length) -> length
    allow sub(length) -> length
val a = 100_m
val b = 50_m
expect (a + b).value() == 150
```

